flowchart TD
  Browser[Browser and CLI or MCP] --> API[Lambda API with shared domain services]
  Browser --> Cognito[Cognito identity]
  API --> Auth[Authoritative pool authorization]
  Auth --> DB[(DynamoDB records and durable work)]
  API -->|Commit revision and indexing intent| DB
  DB -->|Stream event| Indexer[Idempotent indexing Lambda]
  Indexer --> Embeddings[Embedding provider]
  Indexer --> Vectors[S3 Vectors derived index]
  API -->|Bounded pool-scoped similarity query| Vectors
  API -->|Recheck permission and revision before returning text| DB
  DB -->|Delivery intent| Sender[Invitation Lambda]
  Sender --> SES[SES]
